      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently: OWML’s stability has been battered pretty hard by SDK 3.10, and KitKatJetSim requires a 3rd party relative object sync (projects for that became non-functional after SDK 3.9) to work with SaccFlight. These systems are among the hardest things to develop and test in Udon (this is the understatement of the century), so developing a new one is not reasonable (ask me how I know) and repairing them is agonizing, massively time consuming, torturous work.\n\nThis issue is so much easier for VRC to solve on their end (all of this is workarounds and fighting a hostile test environment for precision networking that wouldnt be necessary from inside) that a SDK component or mode is the only practical solution.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
