      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So... coming back to this, i found this from Unity themselves: https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/com.unity.gis.high-precision-framework\n\nWould this possibly be implemented for VRChat to at least get double precision worlds?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
